      "text": "Asteroid sizes",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "text": "A small rock holds the same amount whether it is minerals or spice, and so does a large one, on every map.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spice is rare instead: about one rock in seven. Belts differ in their mix: a rich belt has more big rocks, a poor one mostly small.",
